# THE SIFREI ROWS OF PISKAOT 184-188 (THE DEUTERONOMY WALK sitting 16 — CHAPTERS 19-21, LEAN, 2026-09-24): the border enlarged as the reward, all by the fathers'
# merit (184); three, six, nine — R. Nehorai's twelve, R. Saul's fifteen (185); the court warned on innocent blood, the ladder from hatred to bloodshed (186);
# all who kill run to the cities and the court sends, the guilty killed, the innocent released, the exiled returned, the intentional killer given up, by any
# man's hand, the evil-doers purged (187 — HEADLESS, read whole); the landmark two prohibitions, in the land alone, the tribes' bounds, the traditions confused,
# the ancestral tomb sold; one witness for money, offerings, lashes, lineage, the woman, R. Judah and R. Yose on the oath; by the mouth not the writing nor
# an interpreter; the jealous husband's two and one (188). Every row READ WHOLE in both files; the cuts by ch19_ink.SP_. Sitting 15's form.
